    "steam_appid": 2383960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.poster.avif?t=1733865628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.webm?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.mp4?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/c501dc399294dec78cd457e3cfe892df.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Welcome to Shroom Siege, a fast-paced multiplayer game that balances strategy and fun with a low barrier of entry. Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the genre, jump into the action as a shroom character in 4 vs 4 matches. Coordinate with your teammates and use quick thinking to outsmart your opponents in this easy-to-learn, hard-to-master experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f17d49f2d458e7f96d096c9b2289d6e0.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Shroom Siege brings together the best aspects of local and online multiplayer games, making it a versatile choice for any gaming session. Whether you're sharing a couch with friends or playing with others from around the globe, this game ensures a dynamic experience tailored to your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's more, Shroom Siege supports cross-play across Steam and Nintendo Switch platforms, bringing together an even larger community of players. This means you can compete with friends and others regardless of their chosen platform. And don't worry if you're short of human players - AI steps in to balance the 4v4 gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the added convenience of a free demo with online capabilities, Shroom Siege provides a rich and accessible gaming experience for all. No matter your platform or location, it's always the perfect time for a siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/a8b613e8f71aafd4dcdce1771f082d5c.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Taking cues from the arcade hit, Killer Queen, Shroom Siege introduces its unique gameplay mechanics. It's a game that's easy to pick up, yet offers depth and complexity for those who crave a strategic challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7a4f211634f7454a6ecd1eb61d2b366c.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>In Shroom Siege, there are three unique ways to claim victory. Aim for a Shogun Victory by defeating the opposing team's Shogun thrice, spread your spore across the map and capture all shrines for a Shrine Victory, or strategically move the poop into your goal for a Poop Victory. But remember, you can't perform any actions without first mounting a character, adding an additional layer of strategy to your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.poster.avif?t=1733865628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.webm?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.mp4?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0f412ac3387ac723f212b99d664b0ead.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>To ensure fair and engaging battles, Shroom Siege features a matchmaking system that pairs you with players of similar skill level. Whether you're a newcomer or a seasoned player, you'll find matches that are challenging and enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7fbebad1e59539883560e6dd78c3be10.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Shroom Siege is designed with controller play in mind, making it easy for anyone to join the fun. With a controller or a keyboard, you can dive right into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.poster.avif?t=1733865628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.webm?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.mp4?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Shroom Siege offers a balanced blend of strategy, action, and fun. So, gather your friends or join the online community, and let's start the siege!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.poster.avif?t=1733865628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.webm?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0b3ff33ac521f265089d0ae2ca062bbc.mp4?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/c501dc399294dec78cd457e3cfe892df.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Welcome to Shroom Siege, a fast-paced multiplayer game that balances strategy and fun with a low barrier of entry. Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the genre, jump into the action as a shroom character in 4 vs 4 matches. Coordinate with your teammates and use quick thinking to outsmart your opponents in this easy-to-learn, hard-to-master experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f17d49f2d458e7f96d096c9b2289d6e0.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Shroom Siege brings together the best aspects of local and online multiplayer games, making it a versatile choice for any gaming session. Whether you're sharing a couch with friends or playing with others from around the globe, this game ensures a dynamic experience tailored to your setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's more, Shroom Siege supports cross-play across Steam and Nintendo Switch platforms, bringing together an even larger community of players. This means you can compete with friends and others regardless of their chosen platform. And don't worry if you're short of human players - AI steps in to balance the 4v4 gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the added convenience of a free demo with online capabilities, Shroom Siege provides a rich and accessible gaming experience for all. No matter your platform or location, it's always the perfect time for a siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/a8b613e8f71aafd4dcdce1771f082d5c.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Taking cues from the arcade hit, Killer Queen, Shroom Siege introduces its unique gameplay mechanics. It's a game that's easy to pick up, yet offers depth and complexity for those who crave a strategic challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7a4f211634f7454a6ecd1eb61d2b366c.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>In Shroom Siege, there are three unique ways to claim victory. Aim for a Shogun Victory by defeating the opposing team's Shogun thrice, spread your spore across the map and capture all shrines for a Shrine Victory, or strategically move the poop into your goal for a Poop Victory. But remember, you can't perform any actions without first mounting a character, adding an additional layer of strategy to your gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.poster.avif?t=1733865628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.webm?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7f25a305322a6e817d5e3e2ad0181ee9.mp4?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/0f412ac3387ac723f212b99d664b0ead.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>To ensure fair and engaging battles, Shroom Siege features a matchmaking system that pairs you with players of similar skill level. Whether you're a newcomer or a seasoned player, you'll find matches that are challenging and enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/7fbebad1e59539883560e6dd78c3be10.avif?t=1733865628\" /></span>Shroom Siege is designed with controller play in mind, making it easy for anyone to join the fun. With a controller or a keyboard, you can dive right into the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.poster.avif?t=1733865628\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.webm?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2383960/extras/f3dd96ed600445fa49b082189b535375.mp4?t=1733865628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Shroom Siege offers a balanced blend of strategy, action, and fun. So, gather your friends or join the online community, and let's start the siege!</p>",
    "short_description": "Shroom Siege is a fast-paced, strategic multiplayer game with a low barrier of entry, where you control a shroom and mount other characters to claim victory. With three unique ways to win, it's perfect for those who love action and strategy, whether you're a seasoned player or just getting started.",
